1
00:00:20,239 --> 00:00:20,760
Miss.

2
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,679
Someone asked me to give you this box.

3
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,440
Thank you.

4
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:34,679
Western outskirts, noon.
Trade the Coastal Defense Map for Li Mingyuan.

5
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:36,520
Don't let anyone know.

6
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:39,240
Otherwise, his head rolls.

7
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,799
We won't wait.

8
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:58,799
Young Master,

9
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:00,079
what happened to you?

10
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:00,960
It's nothing.

11
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,840
Ran into some reckless robbers.

12
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:03,880
Fired a few shots,

13
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,799
and drove them off.

14
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,799
Miss Jiang didn't say a word

15
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:08,120
and suddenly took off.

16
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:10,079
We found this in her room.

17
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,319
Behave yourself!

18
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,159
Li Mingyuan,

19
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:45,920
you're quite clever,

20
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,599
teaming up with Lian Ye to fool me so completely.

21
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,239
Too bad

22
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,799
you have such an idiot by your side.

23
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,840
Such a clumsy trick,

24
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,480
yet it actually lured her out.

25
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,560
What will it take for you to let her go?

26
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,840
Hand over your last Coastal Defense Map.

27
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:04,280
No! Without the Coastal Defense Map,

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,599
I'm not worth saving!

29
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,040
You can't give him the Coastal Defense Map!

30
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,039
I'm not worth it!

31
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,520
You don't get a say here!

32
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,479
Are you trading or not?

33
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,120
I'll trade.

34
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,199
Go.

35
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,439
At least you still have a conscience.

36
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:44,240
She didn't risk her life for you in vain.

37
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,439
Go.

38
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,439
It's my fault.

39
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,759
I made everyone's efforts go to waste.

40
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,400
I deserve to die.

41
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:57,639
I was so stupid.

42
00:02:58,199 --> 00:03:00,159
It's okay. Trust me.

43
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,680
I thought I'd never see you again.

44
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,599
Sister Dieyi, I'm sorry.

45
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,879
It's all my fault for being so reckless.

46
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:34,000
The Coastal Defense Map is now in Sun Hanji's hands.

47
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,479
Don't blame yourself.

48
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,719
Anyone would have chosen to save a life.

49
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,479
Mr. Matsui, Mr. Matsui!

50
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:49,680
I've recovered the complete Coastal Defense Map

51
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:52,680
to do my humble part for the Major General's cause!

52
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,360
You idiot!

53
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,240
Look for yourself!

54
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:09,879
This...

55
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,919
Who did this?

56
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,639
Are you asking me?

57
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:16,040
I... I...

58
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:17,279
I really don't know!

59
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:27,319
Brother Mingyuan, it's all up to you now.

60
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,240
If we didn't need every man right now,

61
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,319
I'd have your heads chopped off!

62
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,480
You're all stripped of your ranks

63
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:44,040
and demoted to private second class.

64
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,879
In future battles, kill more Japanese

65
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,879
to redeem yourselves!

66
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,920
Yes, sir!

67
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,079
Pass down the order.

68
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,120
Adjust troop deployments.

69
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,879
Redraw the Coastal Defense Map.

70
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:09,959
Yes, sir.

71
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,680
Come on out.

72
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:24,519
Mingyuan, using the Japanese as cover,

73
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,879
you printed the Coastal Defense Map in the papers.

74
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,279
Blurring truth and falsehood,

75
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,680
so everyone could see it.

76
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,319
After all, they can't punish everyone, right?

77
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:36,079
You forced our hand to alter the Coastal Defense Map,

78
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:38,600
turning real into fake,

79
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:40,680
just to clear those in the know.

80
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,839
What sheer audacity!

81
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:45,360
Senior, circumstances forced my hand.

82
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,759
I had no other choice.

83
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:48,279
Reckless insubordination!

84
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,360
Death is too good for you!

85
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,639
Drifting like weeds in troubled times,

86
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,160
what did the common folk do wrong?

87
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,360
A soft heart cannot lead an army.

88
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,319
I'm not a commander.

89
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,680
I'm just an ordinary police officer.

90
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,399
Fine, fine.

91
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:04,920
This time, your merits balance out your faults.

92
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,680
Clean up all the loose ends for me.

93
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,879
Don't let me hear any rumors,

94
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:12,560
or I'll hold you solely responsible.

95
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,319
I'll get it done, sir.

96
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,639
Ji Chunyue, you damn bitch!

97
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:25,160
Did you help those sluts

98
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,959
collude with Chen Dieyi?

99
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,560
So what if I did?

100
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:31,000
You've completely lost your mind!

101
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,079
Tell me where those bitches are!

102
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:35,040
I'll slaughter every last one of them!

103
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:38,199
You trapped me here in Minchun Pavilion,

104
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,160
making me commit all kinds of atrocities.

105
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:44,639
I'm no better than an executioner!

106
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,000
I deserve to die!

107
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,160
You...

108
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:53,560
Put out the fire, quick!

109
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,720
It's over. Everything is ruined.

110
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,759
Li Mingyuan.

111
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,839
Lian Ye.

112
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,879
What on earth do you want?

113
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,440
We brought all these people

114
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,840
to settle scores with you.

115
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:46,559
Sun Hanji,

116
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:49,039
you're suspected in multiple homicides.

117
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:51,000
Come to the station with us for questioning.

118
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,039
Listen up, Shipboard Guild!

119
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:57,240
Anyone not involved in the murders

120
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:59,480
is welcome to join our Sanshan Gang.

121
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:03,240
The past will be forgiven,

122
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,279
and we start fresh.

123
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,679
I dare any of you to move!

124
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,639
Any accomplices involved,

125
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:16,919
turn yourselves in right now,

126
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,279
and the police will show leniency!

127
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:32,000
All of you, attack!

128
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,080
Out of the way!

129
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,039
What do you want?

130
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,159
Did you have someone burn down my family home?

131
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,960
So what if I did?

132
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,720
Was it you

133
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:10,519
who sent Chen Dieyi to Minchun Pavilion?

134
00:10:11,679 --> 00:10:12,480
It was me.

135
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:22,639
This arm

136
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:25,159
is payback for Chen Dieyi.

137
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:30,799
This is payback for Bai Yumei.

138
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:40,320
This is payback for Liu Furong.

139
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:48,039
This is payback for the countless souls

140
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,440
who died brutally at your hands!

141
00:11:17,759 --> 00:11:20,480
Who's the one controlling you behind the scenes?

142
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,679
A man...

143
00:11:28,519 --> 00:11:29,759
the higher he climbs,

144
00:11:31,759 --> 00:11:34,399
the-the more he reeks of blood.

145
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,440
If I tell you, will you spare me?

146
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,360
I'll consider it.

147
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,240
It's that Japanese dog, Jiichiro Matsui!

148
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,960
He hates the Lian family.

149
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,960
He swore to make the Lians

150
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,639
slaves and whores for generations!

151
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,320
He forced me to do it!

152
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:08,039
Slaves and whores...

153
00:12:10,399 --> 00:12:12,720
Yes, slaves and whores!

154
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:18,600
Slaves and whores...

155
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:20,240
It has nothing to do with me!

156
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:30,840
Spare me! I can be your dog!

157
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:33,559
You said... you wouldn't kill me!
